    "text": "Land Min No.: LD/05/2005/HW/534. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land which is required for Rehabilitation in the part of Road from 194+120 KM to 197+900 KM of Balangoda Bandarawela Road. Description of the land to be acquired: Allotments of Land in F.V.P. 119, Insert No. 30, Sheet No. 32 prepared by the superintend surveyor in Badulla, situated in Ogodella village in the Bandarawela Divisional secretary's division of the District of Badulla in Uva province described as follows.",
